{"type": "minecraft:notice", "title": {"text": "⚒ Forge des Royaumes", "color": "gold", "bold": true}, "external_title": {"text": "Forge des Royaumes", "color": "gold"}, "body": [{"type": "minecraft:plain_message", "width": 400, "contents": [{"text": "Le hub d'artisanat illustré : onglet Forge de l'inventaire (icônes, ce qu'il te manque).\n", "color": "yellow"}, {"text": "Table de forgeron : pose-la, puis lâche dessus (touche ", "color": "gray", "extra": [{"keybind": "key.drop"}, {"text": ") les ingrédients ; ils fusionnent seuls.\n\n"}]}, {"text": "• Lingot de Sigmarite", "color": "gold"}, {"text": " : 3 gold ingot, 2 lapis lazuli, 1 Pierre des Royaumes brute\n", "color": "white"}, {"text": "• Lingot de Sigmarite (raffinage d'éclats d'Azyr)", "color": "gold"}, {"text": " : 3 Éclat d'Azyr, 1 gold ingot\n", "color": "white"}, {"text": "• Parchemin de Gloire", "color": "gold"}, {"text": " : 3 Pierre des Royaumes brute, 1 paper\n", "color": "white"}, {"text": "• Arc de Novice Vanari de Hysh", "color": "gold"}, {"text": " : 6 Éclat d'Hysh, 1 bow\n", "color": "white"}, {"text": "• Fusil à Aether", "color": "gold"}, {"text": " : 8 Éclat de Chamon, 1 crossbow\n", "color": "white"}, {"text": "• Brume d'Ulgu", "color": "gold"}, {"text": " : 2 Éclat d'Ulgu, 1 glass bottle\n", "color": "white"}, {"text": "• Festin d'Ogor ×2", "color": "gold"}, {"text": " : 1 Éclat de Ghur, 4 cooked beef\n", "color": "white"}, {"text": "• Lumière de Hysh", "color": "gold"}, {"text": " : 2 Éclat d'Hysh, 1 glass bottle\n", "color": "white"}, {"text": "• Tonique d'Aqshy", "color": "gold"}, {"text": " : 2 Éclat d'Aqshy, 1 glass bottle\n", "color": "white"}, {"text": "• Élixir de Ghyran ×2", "color": "gold"}, {"text": " : 2 Éclat de Ghyran, 2 glass bottle\n", "color": "white"}, {"text": "• Élixir de Malepierre", "color": "gold"}, {"text": " : 1 Malepierre, 1 glass bottle\n", "color": "white"}, {"text": "• Amulette d'Ambre", "color": "gold"}, {"text": " : 6 Éclat de Ghur, 2 gold ingot\n", "color": "white"}, {"text": "• Comète de Sigmar [réservé : Ordre]", "color": "gold"}, {"text": " : 6 Lingot de Sigmarite, 2 Éclat d'Hysh\n", "color": "white"}, {"text": "• Cœur de Hysh", "color": "gold"}, {"text": " : 6 Éclat d'Hysh, 2 gold ingot\n", "color": "white"}, {"text": "• Pendentif d'Ombre", "color": "gold"}, {"text": " : 6 Éclat d'Ulgu, 2 gold ingot\n", "color": "white"}, {"text": "• Talisman de Grimnir", "color": "gold"}, {"text": " : 6 Éclat de Chamon, 2 gold ingot\n", "color": "white"}, {"text": "• Œil des Dieux Sombres [réservé : Chaos]", "color": "gold"}, {"text": " : 6 Éclat du Chaos, 2 Malepierre\n", "color": "white"}, {"text": "• Calice de Rotigus (boss)", "color": "gold"}, {"text": " : 16 Éclat de Ghyran, 8 Éclat du Chaos\n", "color": "white"}, {"text": "• Cloche de Thanquol (boss)", "color": "gold"}, {"text": " : 24 Malepierre, 4 Pierre des Royaumes brute\n", "color": "white"}, {"text": "• Crâne de Skarbrand (boss)", "color": "gold"}, {"text": " : 24 Éclat d'Aqshy, 4 Éclat du Chaos\n", "color": "white"}, {"text": "• Sceau d'Archaon (boss)", "color": "gold"}, {"text": " : 24 Éclat du Chaos, 4 Pierre des Royaumes brute\n", "color": "white"}, {"text": "• Sceau de Nagash (boss)", "color": "gold"}, {"text": " : 24 Éclat de Shyish, 4 Pierre des Royaumes brute\n", "color": "white"}, {"text": "• Totem de Gordrakk (boss)", "color": "gold"}, {"text": " : 24 Ferraille d'Orruk, 8 Éclat de Ghur\n", "color": "white"}]}], "action": {"label": {"text": "Fermer"}, "width": 100}}